        "production_scoring": false,
        "production_scoring_reason": "A guarded Modal campaign completed, but it does not qualify another account's environment, cache Volume, price record, or target controls. This portable template stays at candidate claim level until the operator resolves those live facts and qualifies the selected arm for the campaign target.",
